# Solution

```text
lib/MediatR/            CQRS — see mediatr.mdc + lib/MediatR/README.md
src/Infrastructure/     Persistence, Database, Mailbox, Foundry — infrastructure.mdc
src/Application/        Features, AI, Models — application.mdc; DI in `DependencyInjection.cs`
src/WebApp/             Blazor UI, Endpoints — webapp.mdc
```

**References:** `Application → Infrastructure` + `MediatR` · `WebApp → Application`

## Least scope first (global)

Start at the **smallest place that works**; promote only when reuse or boundaries require it. Do not skip levels.

| Layer | Start | Promote to |
|-------|--------|------------|
| **Infrastructure** | One concern folder (`Mailbox/`, `Foundry/`) with `Abstractions` + `DTOs` + `Helpers` + impl | New `{Concern}/` folder for a new external system |
| **Application — data** | Handler `# Private Helpers` + `IDbContextFactory` | `{Slice}/Repository.cs` → `Shared/Repository.cs` |
| **Application — logic** | Handler private | `{Slice}/Helpers.cs` → `Shared/Helpers.cs` |
| **Application — technical** | Inline or local static | `Application/Utilities/` (crypto, etc.) — not slice DTO mapping |
| **Application — services** | Handler private or slice class | `{Slice}/Services.cs` → `Shared/Services.cs` |
| **Application — slice sub-concern** (optional) | Inline in handler | `{Slice}/{Concern}.cs` before a consolidated `Helpers.cs` |
| **Application — AI** | Slice repos | `SharedRepository` for cross-slice; never `IDbContextFactory` |
| **WebApp** | Page-local private helpers | `Components/Shared/` or `Utilities/` when reused |

**Slice ↔ Shared (one-to-one file names):**

| | `{Slice}/` | `Features/Shared/` |
|---|------------|-------------------|
| Read shapes | `DTOs.cs` | `DTOs.cs` |
| Data access | `Repository.cs` | `Repository.cs` |
| Logic / mapping | `Helpers.cs` | `Helpers.cs` |
| Facades / orchestration | `Services.cs` | `Services.cs` |

Omit a file until the slice needs it. Promote local → shared when reuse crosses slices.

Project-specific escalation detail: `application.mdc`, `infrastructure.mdc`.

## Where new code goes

| Question | Place |
|----------|--------|
| DB entity / SQL table | `Infrastructure/Persistence/Entities/` + `Infrastructure/Database/dbo/Tables/` |
| Manual migration | `Infrastructure/Database/Migrations/` |
| EF mapping | `Infrastructure/Persistence/AppDbContext.cs` |
| External adapter (mail, AI) | `Infrastructure/{Concern}/` |
| Use case | `Application/Features/{Slice}/Commands\|Queries/` |
| LLM / agents / memory | `Application/AI/` |
| Blazor UI | `WebApp/Components/` |
| HTTP API | `WebApp/Endpoints/` |

## Startup (`WebApp/Startup.cs`)

- `AddInfrastructure(configuration)` + `CurrentUser`
- `AddApplication(configuration)` — repos, MediatR, AI, services

## Foundry secrets

`Foundry:Enabled`, `Foundry:Endpoint`, `Foundry:ApiKey` in user secrets / env — never commit.

